===============================================================================
2. Keyboard layout tables — engine/src/keyboard.ts
===============================================================================

The key-to-component tables for the Standard (大千式), IBM and ETen layouts were
transcribed from McBopomofo's src/Mandarin/BopomofoKeyboardLayout.ts (MIT), which
carries a per-layout test suite. The Hsu (許氏) and ETen26 layouts are NOT
included, precisely because transcribing them without an authoritative,
tested source would introduce silent errors.

